  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūfunya kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako ng'ombe nūūlū ng'holo īyo īlī na būlemehazu nūūlū būsaatu gīkī shibize shitambò kūlī we; nguno ū mhayo gwenūyo gūlī gwa malofu no ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa kūkenaagūla ilagane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ngosha, nūūlū nkīma ūyo akwikalaga hamò nang'ho mu nzengo gūmò gwa mizengo īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha, ūbonwa alīīta yabūbi kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, alīlīkenaagūla ī lilagane lyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu nzīla ya kūbatūmamīla bamulungu bangī na kūbalamya, nūūlū kūlamya līīmi na ng'weji nūūlū sonda ja ng'wigūlū, ūbiza alīīta īyo nalīmulemeja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū mhayo gwenūyo ūlū gūshishiwa mu matū gako, īkūkwigeleelwa ūgūgīsīlīje mu welwa ng'holò. Ūlū gūbiza gwa ng'hana hūna yūmanika gīkī mhayo gwa malofu gīko gwītilwe ū mu Isilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū munhū ūyo wagwītile ū gwabūbi ng'wenūyo, abize ngosha nūūlū nkīma, ndimagi muntwale kū mita gwa ha nzengo gwing'we mukamponde mawe ache. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū akūbūlagwa kūlwa būkaanīji bo banhū babīlī nūūlū badatū; atizigela wa kūbūlagwa kūlwa būkaanīji bo munhū ūmò dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A hikanza lya kūbūlagwa, a makono ga bakaanīji bakwe gabize ga kwandya ū kūmponda, hū na a banhū a bangī bamponde kūshisha ache. Īkwigeleelilwe ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu bing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji balī balamuji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūpandīka mihayo ya kwigeleelwa kūshika kwibanza, alīyo yūbiza milambu ū kūlī bebe, yūkūlemeela ū kwīgoloola; hamo mihayo gītī ya būbūlagi, yombo kūlwa wilemeelwa būlebe, nūūlū banhū kwitūla, ī yenīyo ūkwītwala ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA Mulungu wako alalīsole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkwīshisha kū būtongi wa bagabīji, a Balawī, ūūkīyoolecha kū būtongi wa namuji, ūyo alī ntaale ū mu shikū jenījo. Basomboolelage a benabo bakūkwinha ū būlamuji ūbo wigeleelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īkūkwigeleelwa wīte gīt'ūmo balakūwīlīle ko ū kwipandī īlo SEEBA alalīsole. Wilang'hane gete, wīshikīlīje pyī īyo balakūwīle kwīyīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīte kūlenganīla nī shilagīlo īsho bakūkūlanga, nū būlamuji ūbo bakūkwinha; hama yaya ū kwīdalaha īyo balakūtonge, ūtizūgema nūūlū hado kūbiza na mbyūla miso ya kūlola kūnū na kūnū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ose ose ūyo oolecha būdalahi kūlī ngabīji, nūūlū namuji ūyo īmīīlile a ha nīmo gwenūyo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako, ū ng'wenūyo shing'wigeleelilwe kūbūlagwa; īkūkwigeleelwa ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko bakwigwa pye a banhū bogohe booye ū būdalahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūyo shiigelile abize ntemi wako",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū līlashike ī likanza lya kwingīla ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha, hūna wīdima yūbiza yako wikala mo; hanuma ūhaya, “Ī gete nane natūūle ntemi, nabize gīt'ūmo galī a mahanga ayo ganipīndije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ilang'hanage gete, nguno shikwigeleelilwe kūtūūla ntemi ūyo asolilwe na SEEBA Mulungu wako, shiigelile abize ūmò wa baana ba ng'wing'we. Yaya ū kūtūūla munhū wihanga līngī, ūyo atī Ng'wisilaeli ng'wiching'wi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū ntemi ng'wenūyo atigeleelilwe kūsaba falasa ningī jakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; na wilang'hane atizūbatūma a banhū kūja Misili kūjūkooba falasa jingī; nguno Ū SEEBA wamuwīla, “Mutalizūgima kūshoka hangī ū kwenūko gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū ntemi yaya kūpalīka bakīma bingī, nguno bakūngalūcha ī ng'holò yakwe; nū kūsaba no no no ī hela nī zahabu yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wigasha a hisumbī lya būtemi, īkūng'wigeleelwa kwandīka mu shitabo shakwe wei ng'wenekīlī ī mihayo ya shilagīlo īshi, andīke kūfuma ū mu shilagīlo īsho bakikalaga nasho bagabīji, a Balawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo shenīshi akūbiza wa kwikala nasho būl'ikanza, ayūshisoma būlī lūshikū, pyī ū mu būlamu wakwe; adūle kūng'ogoha ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, na kūbiza ng'welwa ng'holò ū kūshimīzīla mo ū mu shilagīlo ī shose īshi, hamò na a malange genaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizigūngūhya wei ng'wenekīlī na kūshidalaha ī shilagīlo ū mu ng'holò yakwe, akandya kūtagaalīja akūlondeelaga mamihayo sagala; kūshisha nose pye a baana ba ng'wawe abadalahe; ibone gīkī ū wei nī kaya yakwe hū bene dūhū abo bigeleelilwe būtemi ū mu Isilaeli shikū ja būja na būja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
